L|Graph.KG.FHIRGraph.1|1846|0|		}
L|Graph.KG.FHIRGraph.1|1847|0|	}
L|Graph.KG.FHIRGraph.1|1848|0|	// --- the patient compartment, from the reference edges just wanted (R2) ----
L|Graph.KG.FHIRGraph.1|1849|0|	// One edge per Patient; via lists every compartment param that reaches it.
