L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelAdjacency.1|130|0|            For {
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelAdjacency.1|131|0|                Set dst = $Order(^KG("out", src, pred, dst))
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelAdjacency.1|132|0|                Quit:dst=""
