L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelAdjacency.1|138|0|        }
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelAdjacency.1|139|0|        Set line = sIdx _ ":" _ nbrs _ $Char(10)
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelAdjacency.1|140|0|        If $Length(result) + $Length(line) > 3000000 {
