L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelCentrality.1|114|14|                Set fnidN = $ZF(-4, 3, dllid, "kg_betweenness_neighborhood_v")
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelCentrality.1|115|14|                If fnidN > 0 {
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelCentrality.1|116|14|                    Set idxList = "", idx = ""
