L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelCentrality.1|303|15|    Set firstNode = $Order(^NKG("$NI",""))
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelCentrality.1|304|15|    If firstNode = "" Quit "ERROR:^NKG not built"
