L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelTraversal.1|404|10|PPRNative(seedId,alpha,maxIter=20,topK=20) methodimpl { s:'($d(alpha)#2) alpha=0.85
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelTraversal.1|405|10|    Set useNKG = ##class(Graph.KG.NKGAccelLoader).UseNKG()
