L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelTraversal.1|421|0|    // Build local adjacency
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelTraversal.1|422|10|    For i = 0:1:n-1 {
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelTraversal.1|423|132|        Set nodeId = nodes.%Get(i).id
