L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelTraversal.1|467|0|    // Power iteration
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelTraversal.1|468|10|    For iter = 1:1:maxIter {
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelTraversal.1|469|140|        For i = 0:1:n-1 { Set ^||pprNext(i) = 0 }
L|Graph.KG.NKGAccelTraversal.1|470|140|        For i = 0:1:n-1 {
